# livedesk_theme.pdl — SHIPPED tearit-hq theme.
# Deliberately LOUD: bright-yellow bar, red letters. This is the "not
# your normal desk — an install / test build is running" signal, so the
# owner never confuses a shipped/test taskbar with their dev one on the
# same display. Change these once the install pipeline is past the
# test-alongside-dev phase.
SECTION      | KEY                | VALUE
----------------------------------------
COLOR        | bg                   | #ffd400
COLOR        | fg                   | #c00000
COLOR        | opacity              | 1.00
